      "reason": "Actual public proof calls original-input parent61 with exactly hα,hαβ,hV,hH,hη,hβη and returns every parent witness/property unchanged. All probabilities, every-y normalized density, stationary disintegration, selfadjoint contractive mean-preserving per-u AE T and D/root positivity are internal conclusions.",
